        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OZs1d0Qnioq1vcxTSE0lVF5lg3U\"><em><strong>The graph below shows the average house prices in 3 countries between the years 1997-2014. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "sort": 1,
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>&nbsp;IELTS Writing Task 1 - Average House Price across three countries in 1997 and 2014&nbsp;</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CYVsdh3adoPqlLxBlWcl4gUVgwd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/task-1-line-charts\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Giới thiệu dạng Line Graphs</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WzbldxsHvoEmSdxHZSalPqZUg4b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i JAverage House Price across three countries in 1997 and 2014 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về về gi&aacute; nh&agrave; trung b&igrave;nh ở 3 quốc gia (Country A, B, C) trong khoảng thời gian từ năm 1997 đến năm 2014.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLFYdUG36o4o85xAOPBlI161gNd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuyet-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tuyệt đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span><strong> </strong>trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UEs9dlyx2okrTPxmScBl9NDNgwh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Average House Price across three countries in 1997 and 2014&nbsp; với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: gi&aacute; nh&agrave; trung b&igrave;nh - 3 quốc gia kh&aacute;c nhau - từ năm 1997 đến năm 2014.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SMCAdCHAAo2jQNxu5Fplz84fgmb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Học c&aacute;ch viết Introduction</strong> cho <strong>tất cả</strong> c&aacute;c b&agrave;i dạng <strong>Line Graphs</strong> ở đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute; &rarr;<strong> </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/intro-line\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">C&aacute;ch viết Introduction dạng LINE</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEbsd2QXSos0HUxGNcHlF0ntgab\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BPLHdZ1AWonL9Zx1HAklrflQgAd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NrEfdeA32oruHJxpv0CltBnPg7d\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FCkCdAPs9oUNGVxxTwhlgylYgjc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><strong>Trends:</strong> Cả 3 quốc gia đều c&oacute; xu hướng tăng gi&aacute; nh&agrave; trong suốt giai đoạn được thể hiện <em>(all upward trend)</em>.</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><strong>Differences:</strong> Country A duy tr&igrave; gi&aacute; nh&agrave; cao nhất trong phần lớn thời kỳ, đặc biệt từ năm 2001 trở đi <em>(highest throughout most of the period)</em>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pi8FdlqEUoy6aGxXSiglpGrIgeh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Country A (gi&aacute; trị cao nhất v&agrave; biến động dramatic nhất)</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IrAwd9JxtorDimxNXDOlx9MTgjb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mv4ydageCozWmrxlQq1lediYgyh\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 1) <strong>N&ecirc;u số liệu năm đầu ti&ecirc;n</strong> <em>(1997: Country A bắt đầu ở mức $150,000)</em>.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mv4ydageCozWmrxlQq1lediYgyh\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng ch&iacute;nh của Country A với peak đầu ti&ecirc;n</strong> <em>(tăng mạnh l&ecirc;n $530,000 năm 2003, sau đ&oacute; giảm xuống $460,000 năm 2006)</em>.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mv4ydageCozWmrxlQq1lediYgyh\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 3) <strong>Tiếp tục m&ocirc; tả giai đoạn sau</strong> <em>(phục hồi v&agrave; đạt peak thứ hai ở $615,000 năm 2012, rồi ổn định ở $620,000 v&agrave;o năm 2014)</em>.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TjNPd6TvCoVV5Hxq9TQlhCehgNb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BbzKdPgEyoLpsjx7kYIlQ0Q1g4g\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S0l8dkGHhoeVf1xdcuPlhdbRgHd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YFozdR2IuosAukxF4wqlDPA0gnh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Country B v&agrave; Country C (gi&aacute; trị thấp hơn v&agrave; c&oacute; pattern tương tự nhau)</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZFQdbZvYoA2RXxrWTdlYAEJgtc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OakHdjIq4oN7KmxKkddlvVE7gKx\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm đầu ti&ecirc;n của cả 2 countries</strong> <em>(1997: Country B l&agrave; $130,000, Country C thấp hơn ở mức $100,000).</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OakHdjIq4oN7KmxKkddlvVE7gKx\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng của Country B</strong> <em>(tăng l&ecirc;n $375,000 năm 2005, giảm xuống $270,000 năm 2008, phục hồi đạt peak $520,000 năm 2012, giảm nhẹ xuống $490,000 năm 2014).</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OakHdjIq4oN7KmxKkddlvVE7gKx\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng của Country C v&agrave; so s&aacute;nh với Country B</strong> <em>(tăng đều l&ecirc;n $240,000 năm 2007, giảm mạnh xuống $150,000 năm 2008 - similar pattern, sau đ&oacute; phục hồi kết th&uacute;c ở $280,000 năm 2014).</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TN6Fd9B0PohTNjxAWltlSG3sgUg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MgpOdgFa5orVtdxiKOPliFF8gih\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RYRddABRToQrqNxG0fSl7OrOg5c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YdvRdtEEMoe1nqxSg4NlhL6GgQf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WIUnd6WAUoXWJSx4xA3lyHevgsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GzVudZspKo0jPLxbMunl1LTAgjc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi muốn diễn đạt \"<strong>gi&aacute; nh&agrave;\"</strong>, thay v&igrave; d&ugrave;ng \"<strong>house price\"</strong>, m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể paraphrase th&agrave;nh:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GzVudZspKo0jPLxbMunl1LTAgjc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<ul>\n<li>housing costs <em>(chi ph&iacute; nh&agrave; ở)</em></li>\n<li>property prices <em>(gi&aacute; bất động sản)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TuK9dgT5AoBU6KxgM0plA894gId\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NvYsd4I6NoNXSxxNnTolfHG5gee\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">All three countries experienced an upward trend in average <strong>housing costs</strong>.<br>Notably, Country A consistently maintained the highest <strong>property prices</strong> for the majority of the timeframe, particularly from 2001 onwards.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 3044,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>The line graph illustrates the changes in average house prices in three different countries over a 17-year period from 1997 to 2014.</p>",
            "question_id": 41439,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3045,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<p>Overall, all three countries experienced an upward trend in average housing costs throughout the period shown. Notably, Country A consistently maintained the highest property prices for the majority of the timeframe, particularly from 2001 onwards.</p>",
            "question_id": 41439,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3046,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p>Starting with Country A, house prices stood at $150,000 in 1997. The figures then witnessed a dramatic surge, reaching a peak of approximately $530,000 in 2003, before declining to around $460,000 by 2006. Following this dip, prices rose sharply once more, hitting another peak of $615,000 in 2012, before stabilizing at roughly $620,000 at the end of the period.</p>",
            "question_id": 41439,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3047,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p>Regarding the other two countries, in 1997, Country B's average house price was $130,000, while Country C recorded a lower figure of $100,000. Country B saw its values climb to $375,000 in 2005, then experienced a notable drop to $270,000 in 2008. Subsequently, the prices recovered and peaked at $520,000 in 2012, before declining slightly to finish at $490,000 in 2014. A similar pattern was observed in Country C, whose figures increased steadily to $240,000 in 2007, but then plummeted significantly to $150,000 in 2008. However, they recovered thereafter, ending the period at $280,000.</p>",
